 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <!-- 匿名页面令牌已移除（公开归档不保留） -->\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112514'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>P1002 [NOIP 2002 普及组] 过河卒 题解 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"yk90rg78\",\"title\":\"P1002 [NOIP 2002 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u8fc7\\u6cb3\\u5352 \\u9898\\u89e3\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1754881688,\"author\":{\"uid\":1490160,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/1490160.png\",\"name\":\"Z20241152\",\"slogan\":\"\\\\^w^\\/~\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Blue\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/xf7isa7z.png\"},\"upvote\":1,\"replyCount\":0,\"favorCount\":1,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1002\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 2002 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u8fc7\\u6cb3\\u5352\",\"difficulty\":2,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":0,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"~~\\uff08\\u6211\\u90fd\\u4e0d\\u4f1a\\u7684\\u6c34\\u9898*1\\uff09~~\\n\\n# \\u8fc7\\u6cb3\\u5352\\u95ee\\u9898\\u662f\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u7ecf\\u5178\\u7684dp\\u52a8\\u6001\\u89c4\\u5212\\u7b97\\u6cd5\\u9898\\n**\\u8981\\u70b9\\uff1a**\\n- \\u68cb\\u76d8\\u5750\\u6807\\u7cfb\\u8bbe\\u5b9a\\u4e3aA(0,0)\\u5230B(n,m)\\u3002\\n-  \\u5352\\u53ea\\u80fd\\u5411\\u4e0b\\u6216\\u5411\\u53f3\\u79fb\\u52a8\\uff0c\\u9a6c\\u7684\\u63a7\\u5236\\u70b9\\u5305\\u62ec\\u81ea\\u8eab\\u4f4d\\u7f6e\\u548c8\\u4e2a\\u65e5\\u5b57\\u5f62\\u8df3\\u8dc3\\u70b9\\n-  \\u9700\\u8981\\u8ba1\\u7b97\\u907f\\u5f00\\u63a7\\u5236\\u70b9\\u7684\\u5408\\u6cd5\\u8def\\u5f84\\u603b\\u6570\\n---\\n\\n\\u8981\\u77e5\\u9053\\uff0c\\u8c61\\u68cb\\u68cb\\u76d8\\u957f\\u5bbd\\u90fd\\u4e3a22\\u683c\\u3002\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u8981\\u60f3\\u5230\\u51fa\\u754c\\u8fd9\\u79cd\\u60c5\\u51b5\\u3002\\n```cpp\\nif(tmpx\\u003E=0\\u0026\\u0026tmpx\\u003C=n\\u0026\\u0026tmpy\\u003E=0\\u0026\\u0026tmpy\\u003C=m)\\n\\/\\/if\\u6761\\u4ef6\\u786e\\u4fdd\\u5750\\u6807\\u5728\\u6709\\u6548\\u8303\\u56f4\\u5185\\uff080\\u2264tmpx \\u2264n0\\u2264tmpy\\u2264m\\uff09\\n```\\n\\n\\u56e0\\u4e3a\\u6570\\u636e\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u8fc7\\u5927\\uff0c\\u6240\\u4ee5\\uff1a\\n## \\u8981\\u5f00LONG LONG\\uff01\\uff01\\uff01\\n\\n### \\u56e0\\u4e3a\\u5352\\u53ea\\u80fd\\u5411\\u4e0b\\u6216\\u5411\\u53f3\\u79fb\\u52a8\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u8fd9\\u5c31\\u662f\\u5352\\u53ef\\u8d70\\u7684\\u8def\\u7ebf\\uff1a\\n![](https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/jrmhwp5q.png)\\n\\n### \\u800c\\u9a6c\\u8d70\\u65e5\\uff0c\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u8fd9\\u5c31\\u662f\\u9a6c\\u53ef\\u8d70\\u7684\\u8def\\u7ebf\\uff1a\\n\\n![](https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/z0i0w0f9.png)\\n\\n\\u4e5f\\u5c31\\u662f\\u8bf4\\uff0c\\u9a6c\\u7684\\u6d3b\\u52a8\\u8303\\u56f4\\u5df2\\u7ecf\\u88ab\\u56fa\\u5b9a\\u4e86\\uff01\\n\\n![](https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/w3a714bl.png)\\n\\n### \\u6240\\u4ee5\\u6211\\u4eec\\u53ea\\u7528\\u627e\\u5230\\u9a6c\\u7684\\u5750\\u6807P1~P8\\u7684\\u5750\\u6807\\uff0c\\u518d\\u53cc\\u91cd\\u5faa\\u73af\\u904d\\u5386\\uff0c\\u9009\\u62e9\\u662f\\u5411\\u4e0b\\u8d70\\u8fd8\\u662f\\u5411\\u53f3\\u8d70\\uff0c\\u6700\\u540e\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u5c31\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u4e86\\uff01\\n\\n---\\n\\n\\u6ce8\\uff1a\\u68cb\\u76d8\\u5750\\u6807\\u7cfb\\u4e2dA(0,0)\\u4e3a\\u8d77\\u70b9\\uff0cB(n,m)\\u4e3a\\u7ec8\\u70b9\\n\\n---\\n## **\\u672c\\u849f\\u84bb\\u7684\\u4ee3\\u7801\\uff1a**\\n\\n```\\ncpp\\n\\/\\/\\u8fc7\\u6cb3\\u5352\\n#include\\u003Ciostream\\u003E\\/\\/\\u8f93\\u5165\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u6d41\\u5934\\u6587\\u4ef6,\\u6700\\u597d\\u7528\\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E \\n#define MAXN 22\\/\\/\\u6362\\u79cd\\u8bf4\\u6cd5\\u5c31\\u662fint MAXN=22; \\nusing namespace std;\\nlong long f[MAXN][MAXN]={0};\\/\\/\\u521d\\u59cb\\u5316\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\u68cb\\u76d8 \\nint ctrl[MAXN][MAXN],n,m,hx,hy;\\/\\/\\u5b9a\\u4e49\\u53d8\\u91cf \\nint d[9][2]={{0,0},{1,2},{1,-2},{-1,2},{-1,-2},{2,1},{2,-1},{-2,1},{-2,-1}};\\n\\/\\/\\u9a6c\\u7684\\u51b3\\u7b56\\u70b9 {0,0},{1,2},{1,-2},{-1,2},{-1,-2},{2,1},{2,-1},{-2,1},{-2,-1}\\u4e5f\\u5c31\\u662fP1~8 \\n\\/\\/\\u9a6c\\u8d70\\u65e5\\u5b57\\uff0c\\u521d\\u59cb\\u70b9\\u4e3a{2,4}\\u3002\\u5411\\u4e0a\\u5411\\u53f3\\u5c31\\u4f1a\\u53d8\\u6210{0,5}\\nint main(){\\n\\tcin\\u003E\\u003En\\u003E\\u003Em\\u003E\\u003Ehx\\u003E\\u003Ehy;\\/\\/\\u8f93\\u5165\\n\\tfor(int i=0;i\\u003C9;i++){\\/\\/\\u5faa\\u73af\\u7ed3\\u6784\\uff1afor(int i=0;i\\u003C9;i++)\\u8868\\u793a\\u904d\\u53869\\u4e2a\\u65b9\\u5411\\n\\tint tmpx=hx+d[i][0],tmpy=hy+d[i][1];\\/\\/d[i][0]\\u548cd[i][1]\\u662f\\u65b9\\u5411\\u504f\\u79fb\\u91cf\\uff08\\u5982\\u4e0a\\u4e0b\\u5de6\\u53f3\\u5bf9\\u89d2\\u7ebf\\u7b49\\uff09\\u3002tmpx\\u548ctmpy\\u8ba1\\u7b97\\u5f97\\u5230\\u76f8\\u90bb\\u5750\\u6807\\n\\tif(tmpx\\u003E=0\\u0026\\u0026tmpx\\u003C=n\\u0026\\u0026tmpy\\u003E=0\\u0026\\u0026tmpy\\u003C=m)\\/\\/if\\u6761\\u4ef6\\u786e\\u4fdd\\u5750\\u6807\\u5728\\u6709\\u6548\\u8303\\u56f4\\u5185\\uff080\\u2264tmpx \\u2264n0\\u2264tmpy\\u2264m\\uff09\\n\\t\\tctrl[tmpx][tmpy]=1;\\/\\/\\u5c06\\u7b26\\u5408\\u6761\\u4ef6\\u7684\\u76f8\\u90bb\\u4f4d\\u7f6ectrl[tmpx][tmpy]\\u8bbe\\u4e3a1\\uff0c\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u4e0d\\u9002\\u5b9c\\u7684\\u5c31\\u4e0d\\u8d70\\uff0c\\u9002\\u5b9c\\u7684\\u5c31\\u8d70\\uff0c\\u76f8\\u5f53\\u4e8e\\u505a\\u4e86\\u4e00\\u5f20\\u5730\\u56fe\\uff0c\\u4e0a\\u9762\\u662f\\u80fd\\u8d70\\u7684\\u8def\\u7ebf\\u3002 \\n\\t}\\/\\/\\u4ee5\\u5750\\u6807\\u70b9(hx, hy)\\u4e3a\\u4e2d\\u5fc3\\uff0c\\u904d\\u5386\\u5176\\u5468\\u56f48\\u4e2a\\u76f8\\u90bb\\u65b9\\u5411\\uff08\\u52a0\\u4e0a\\u81ea\\u8eab\\u51719\\u4e2a\\u4f4d\\u7f6e\\uff09\\uff0c\\u5c06\\u6709\\u6548\\u8303\\u56f4\\u5185\\u7684\\u76f8\\u90bb\\u5750\\u6807\\u6807\\u8bb0\\u4e3a1\\u3002\\n\\tfor(int i=0;i\\u003C=n;i++)\\n\\t\\tfor(int j=0;j\\u003C=m;j++){\\/\\/\\u53cc\\u91cd\\u5faa\\u73af\\u904d\\u5386\\u7f51\\u683c\\n\\t\\t\\tif(ctrl[i][j])continue;\\n\\t\\t\\/\\/continue\\u7528\\u6765\\u5728\\u904d\\u5386\\u6570\\u636e\\u65f6\\u8df3\\u8fc7\\u67d0\\u4e9b\\u7279\\u5b9a\\u503c\\uff08\\u5982\\u8fc7\\u6ee4\\u4e0d\\u7b26\\u5408\\u6761\\u4ef6\\u7684\\u5143\\u7d20\\uff09\\n\\t\\t\\/\\/int n;cin\\u003E\\u003En;for(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++){if(i%2==0)continue;\\u8df3\\u8fc7\\u5076\\u6570cout\\u003C\\u003Ci\\u003C\\u003C\\u0027 \\u0027\\u53ea\\u6253\\u5370\\u5947\\u6570} \\u003C--\\u6837\\u4f8b \\n\\t\\t\\tif(i!=0)f[i][j]+=f[i-1][j];\\/\\/\\u5f53\\u9047\\u5230\\u63a7\\u5236\\u70b9ctrl[i][j]\\u4e3a\\u771f\\u65f6\\u8df3\\u8fc7\\u5f53\\u524d\\u70b9\\uff08continue\\u8bed\\u53e5\\u4f5c\\u7528\\uff09\\n\\t\\t\\tif(j!=0)f[i][j]+=f[i][j-1];\\/\\/f[i][j]=f[i-1][j]+f[i][j-1]\\uff0c\\u5373\\u5f53\\u524d\\u70b9\\u7684\\u8def\\u5f84\\u6570\\u7b49\\u4e8e\\u4e0a\\u65b9\\u548c\\u5de6\\u65b9\\u8def\\u5f84\\u6570\\u4e4b\\u548c\\uff08\\u72b6\\u6001\\u8f6c\\u79fb\\u65b9\\u7a0b\\uff09\\u3002\\n\\t\\tf[0][0]=1-ctrl[0][0];\\/\\/f[0][0]\\u7684\\u503c\\u75311\\u51cf\\u53bb\\u63a7\\u5236\\u70b9ctrl[0][0]\\u51b3\\u5b9a\\uff0c\\u82e5\\u8d77\\u70b9\\u65e0\\u969c\\u788d\\u5219\\u521d\\u59cb\\u503c\\u4e3a1\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\tcout\\u003C\\u003Cf[n][m];\\/\\/\\u6700\\u7ec8\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u4ece\\u8d77\\u70b9\\u5230\\u7ec8\\u70b9\\u53ef\\u8d70\\u7684\\u8def\\u5f84\\u6709\\u591a\\u5c11\\u6761\\u3002 \\n\\treturn 0;\\/\\/\\u7ed3\\u675f\\u7a0b\\u5e8f \\n}\\/\\/\\u7981\\u6b62\\u6284\\u9898\\u89e3\\n```\\n~~\\u559c\\u4e4b\\u90ce\\uff0c\\u591a\\u70b9\\u6536\\u85cf\\u591a\\u70b9\\u8d5e\\u3002~~\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795593074.507011}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/yk90rg78\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"P1002 [NOIP 2002 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u8fc7\\u6cb3\\u5352 \\u9898\\u89e3\",\"description\":\"\\uff08\\u6211\\u90fd\\u4e0d\\u4f1a\\u7684\\u6c34\\u9898*1\\uff09\\n\\u8fc7\\u6cb3\\u5352\\u95ee\\u9898\\u662f\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u7ecf\\u5178\\u7684dp\\u52a8\\u6001\\u89c4\\u5212\\u7b97\\u6cd5\\u9898\\n\\u8981\\u70b9\\uff1a\\n\\n\\u68cb\\u76d8\\u5750\\u6807\\u7cfb\\u8bbe\\u5b9a\\u4e3aA(0,0)\\u5230B(n,m)\\u3002\\n\\u5352\\u53ea\\u80fd\\u5411\\u4e0b\\u6216\\u5411\\u53f3\\u79fb\\u52a8\\uff0c\\u9a6c\\u7684\\u63a7\\u5236\\u70b9\\u5305\\u62ec\\u81ea\\u8eab\\u4f4d\\u7f6e\\u548c8\\u4e2a\\u65e5\\u5b57\\u5f62\\u8df3\\u8dc3\\u70b9\\n\\n\\u9700\\u8981\\u8ba1\\u7b97\\u907f\\u5f00\\u63a7\\u5236\\u70b9\\u7684\\u5408\\u6cd5\\u8def\\u5f84\\u603b\\u6570\\n\\n\\n\\u8981\\u77e5\\u9053\\uff0c\\u8c61\\u68cb\\u68cb\\u76d8\\u957f\\u5bbd\\u90fd\\u4e3a22\\u683c\\u3002\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u8981\\u60f3\\u5230\\u51fa\\u754c\\u8fd9\\u79cd\\u60c5\\u51b5\\u3002\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Z20241152\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-08-11T11:08:08+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"P1002 [NOIP 2002 普及组] 过河卒 题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"（我都不会的水题*1）\n过河卒问题是一个经典的dp动态规划算法题\n要点：\n\n棋盘坐标系设定为A(0,0)到B(n,m)。\n卒只能向下或向右移动，马的控制点包括自身位置和8个日字形跳跃点\n\n需要计算避开控制点的合法路径总数\n\n\n要知道，象棋棋盘长宽都为22格。所以要想到出界这种情况。…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"Z20241152\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-08-11T11:08:08+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/yk90rg78\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>P1002 [NOIP 2002 普及组] 过河卒 题解</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">Z20241152</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-08-11T11:08:08+08:00\">2025-08-11 11:08:08</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p><del>（我都不会的水题*1）</del></p>\n<h1>过河卒问题是一个经典的dp动态规划算法题</h1>\n<p><strong>要点：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>棋盘坐标系设定为A(0,0)到B(n,m)。</li>\n<li>卒只能向下或向右移动，马的控制点包括自身位置和8个日字形跳跃点</li>\n<li>\n<h2>需要计算避开控制点的合法路径总数</h2>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>要知道，象棋棋盘长宽都为22格。所以要想到出界这种情况。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">if(tmpx&gt;=0&amp;&amp;tmpx&lt;=n&amp;&amp;tmpy&gt;=0&amp;&amp;tmpy&lt;=m)\n//if条件确保坐标在有效范围内（0≤tmpx ≤n0≤tmpy≤m）</code></pre>\n<p>因为数据可能过大，所以：</p>\n<h2>要开LONG LONG！！！</h2>\n<h3>因为卒只能向下或向右移动所以这就是卒可走的路线：</h3>\n<p></p>\n<h3>而马走日，所以这就是马可走的路线：</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p>也就是说，马的活动范围已经被固定了！</p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>所以我们只用找到马的坐标P1~P8的坐标，再双重循环遍历，选择是向下走还是向右走，最后输出就可以了！</h3>\n\n<p>注：棋盘坐标系中A(0,0)为起点，B(n,m)为终点</p>\n\n<h2><strong>本蒟蒻的代码：</strong></h2>\n<pre><code>cpp\n//过河卒\n#include&lt;iostream&gt;//输入输出流头文件,最好用&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt; \n#define MAXN 22//换种说法就是int MAXN=22; \nusing namespace std;\nlong long f[MAXN][MAXN]={0};//初始化一下棋盘 \nint ctrl[MAXN][MAXN],n,m,hx,hy;//定义变量 \nint d[9][2]={{0,0},{1,2},{1,-2},{-1,2},{-1,-2},{2,1},{2,-1},{-2,1},{-2,-1}};\n//马的决策点 {0,0},{1,2},{1,-2},{-1,2},{-1,-2},{2,1},{2,-1},{-2,1},{-2,-1}也就是P1~8 \n//马走日字，初始点为{2,4}。向上向右就会变成{0,5}\nint main(){\n    cin&gt;&gt;n&gt;&gt;m&gt;&gt;hx&gt;&gt;hy;//输入\n    for(int i=0;i&lt;9;i++){//循环结构：for(int i=0;i&lt;9;i++)表示遍历9个方向\n    int tmpx=hx+d[i][0],tmpy=hy+d[i][1];//d[i][0]和d[i][1]是方向偏移量（如上下左右对角线等）。tmpx和tmpy计算得到相邻坐标\n    if(tmpx&gt;=0&amp;&amp;tmpx&lt;=n&amp;&amp;tmpy&gt;=0&amp;&amp;tmpy&lt;=m)//if条件确保坐标在有效范围内（0≤tmpx ≤n0≤tmpy≤m）\n        ctrl[tmpx][tmpy]=1;//将符合条件的相邻位置ctrl[tmpx][tmpy]设为1，这样不适宜的就不走，适宜的就走，相当于做了一张地图，上面是能走的路线。 \n    }//以坐标点(hx, hy)为中心，遍历其周围8个相邻方向（加上自身共9个位置），将有效范围内的相邻坐标标记为1。\n    for(int i=0;i&lt;=n;i++)\n        for(int j=0;j&lt;=m;j++){//双重循环遍历网格\n            if(ctrl[i][j])continue;\n        //continue用来在遍历数据时跳过某些特定值（如过滤不符合条件的元素）\n        //int n;cin&gt;&gt;n;for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++){if(i%2==0)continue;跳过偶数cout&lt;&lt;i&lt;&lt;' '只打印奇数} &lt;--样例 \n            if(i!=0)f[i][j]+=f[i-1][j];//当遇到控制点ctrl[i][j]为真时跳过当前点（continue语句作用）\n            if(j!=0)f[i][j]+=f[i][j-1];//f[i][j]=f[i-1][j]+f[i][j-1]，即当前点的路径数等于上方和左方路径数之和（状态转移方程）。\n        f[0][0]=1-ctrl[0][0];//f[0][0]的值由1减去控制点ctrl[0][0]决定，若起点无障碍则初始值为1\n        }\n        cout&lt;&lt;f[n][m];//最终输出从起点到终点可走的路径有多少条。 \n    return 0;//结束程序 \n}//禁止抄题解</code></pre>\n<p><del>喜之郎，多点收藏多点赞。</del></p>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a5ff112aeed1f29d',t:'MTc5NTU5MzA3NA=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a5ff112aeed1f29d',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
